  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Trim pea pods and roughly chop.\n• Pick and thinly slice mint.\n• Slice cucumber into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80df35963fcd98f40ade/step-24378f00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Spread everything garnish over a board or plate. Press cooked haloumi into everything garnish, turning to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80df35963fcd98f40ade/step-fe1a0510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt and half the chopped mint. Season to taste.\n• In a large bowl, combine pea pods, cucumber, spinach & rocket mix, remaining chopped mint and a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil. Toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80df35963fcd98f40ade/step-0ef3cd20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide pea pod salad and sesame-coated haloumi between plates.\n• Dollop over mint yoghurt to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681d80df35963fcd98f40ade/step-75fabd30.jpg"
    }
  ]
